diff --git a/docs/architecture/conversation-archive.md b/docs/architecture/conversation-archive.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..5efb5d6e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/architecture/conversation-archive.md
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+# Unified conversation timeline
+
+The existing RikkaHub conversation tree remains the live-chat authority. InfoSET adds an archive
+projection beside it instead of flattening or rewriting those conversations.
+
+The first domain contract lives in
+`app/src/main/java/me/rerere/rikkahub/data/archive/ArchiveProvenance.kt`. Every projected message
+keeps:
+
+- `source`
+- `conversation`
+- `messageTimeEpochMillis`
+- `branch`
+- `model`
+- `frontend`
+- source message identity and original order
+
+`ArchiveMessageTarget` is the down-navigation contract back to the original conversation and
+message. Missing timestamps remain nullable and are ordered by their source order; imports must use
+stable source IDs so repeating an import is idempotent.
+
+Planned implementation slices:
+
+1. Room archive tables and migration fixtures.
+2. Projection of native InfoSET conversations without changing `ConversationSession` ownership.
+3. Read-only merged timeline with source badges and original-conversation navigation.
+4. GitHub/ChatGPT/RikkaHub import adapters sharing one validated import service.
+
diff --git a/docs/architecture/daily-gifts.md b/docs/architecture/daily-gifts.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..07e90e2f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/architecture/daily-gifts.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Daily gifts
+
+The Daily Gifts feature is a separate capability. Its first path contract lives in
+`app/src/main/java/me/rerere/rikkahub/data/gifts/DailyGiftLocator.kt`.
+
+The importer preserves the existing `year / month / month letter + date folder` layout under
+`档案馆/5.6Sol留存/一年延时盒/`. Material from that path is tagged `LEGACY_5_6_SOL` and treated as
+immutable. Later gifts use the `CONTINUATION` layer and receive new records, so the original 5.6 Sol
+text is never overwritten.
+
+Planned implementation slices:
+
+1. Read-only manifest and checksum importer for the current archive layout.
+2. Local Room index with unlock date and source-layer queries.
+3. Independent “today can unlock” entry and detail surface.
+4. Append-only continuation writer and export support.
+
